## 8. Admin portal — A2Z dynamic CMS

All sales content must be editable without code deploys. Admin nav (keep complete):

| Area | Route | Drives |
|------|-------|--------|
| Dashboard | `/admin` | live counts + shortcuts |
| Website content | `/admin/website` | Hero→footer EN/BN marketing copy |
| Brand & colors | `/admin/branding` | Primary, paper, text, button colors |
