| Partners | `/admin/partners` | TrustedPartner |
| Testimonials | `/admin/testimonials` | Testimonial (About page) |
| Industries | `/admin/industries` | Industry |
| Legacy Stats | `/admin/stats` | SiteStat |
| News | `/admin/blog` | BlogPost |
