| Company | `/admin/company` | CompanyProfile |
| Owner | `/admin/owner` | OwnerProfile |
| EN/BN copy | `/admin/translations` | Translation |

Rules for admin work:
- New public content field → admin UI + API in the same change.
- JSON fields on Product (`images`, `specs`, `packableIds`) — parse safely.
- Public pages must still fall back to `src/data/*` if API is down.
- Admin chrome stays separate from SiteShell; no PWA install chrome on admin.
- Prefer clear factory-owner labels (“Machinery”, “Catalog map”) over developer jargon.

## 9. How to implement

1. Graft ask/grep/callers first.
2. Extend existing components/CSS.
3. EN + BN same PR.
4. brochure.ts = catalog IA; map new CMS machines when they appear in the PDF.
5. Quote CTA on every machinery surface.
6. Verify: home → search/line → product/brochure → quote. Desktop + 375. Dark mode spot-check.
